    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clash of the Kings</strong></h2><br>Build your army lords, the time has come to fight!<br><br><strong>Single-Player:</strong> <br>Battle against fierce foes with your glorious recruits! Level them up, upgrade them, name them! Or let them parish! The choice is yours!<br><br><strong>Multi-player:</strong> <br>Fight against other players armies plunder their loot, and gain much more gold and XP!<br><br><br><strong>Decisions &amp; Randomness:</strong><br>As a new recruit, you could have vastly different stats than the previous. Sometimes it's worth the watch to let the old parish!<br>Almost all items have random stats, even the most fierce foe could parish to a lucky blow, always an underdog, always a chance!<br><br><strong>Game-Play:</strong><br>Level up, and grind your way to the top. As a lord, your new recruits will happily kill/die for you.<br>Constantly manage your economy to support your impressive army, battle random, and dangerous foes.",
